#
# rocksdb.restart_during_drop_cf with rocksdb_enable_remove_orphaned_dropped_cfs=OFF.
#
# The restart happens after the column family was dropped in RocksDB but
# before its id was removed from the list of column families to drop. At
# startup the id is an orphan: with the option ON it is removed, with OFF it is
# only reported, and the drop-index thread must still finish the drop without
# errors.
#
--source suite/rocksdb/t/restart_during_drop_cf.test
